While I suspect that MOST people on this list don't like job postings, IF YOU
MUST post a job listing, keep it brief!  I suspect that a "one line"
description
and a link to the full text is MORE than enough to get the message across.  If
you post ANYTHING more I suspect that it will be ignored if it wasn't already.

One should note that this mailing list is international in nature, and
a job posting for a particular geographical area has VERY limited interest.

